# Keep the build context small and keep secrets out of image layers.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# local env files, never inside an image (the compose file passes the values at run time)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# WhatsApp session of a local run
**/.baileys*

docs
*.md
